[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":518},["ShallowReactive",2],{"splash":3,"i-icons:logo":12,"theMaker":18,"chapters":61,"contactsModal":470,"homepage":481,"i-icons:bracket-open":509,"i-icons:play":513,"i-icons:bracket-close":516},{"id":4,"abstract":5,"extension":6,"meta":7,"soundDisableLabel":8,"soundEnableLabel":9,"stem":10,"__hash__":11},"splash\u002Fsplash.json","Welcome to Virrall, a contemporary womenswear house. A journey through four seasons, made to be worn.","json",{},"Continue without sound","Enter the experience","splash","nD8yFmcYJyWxTetGtoQOqGV4lrkjRoaxdHk4AwWOTEo",{"left":13,"top":13,"width":14,"height":15,"rotate":13,"vFlip":16,"hFlip":16,"body":17},0,447,125,false,"\u003Ctext x=\"223.5\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"78\" letter-spacing=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\">VIRRALL\u003C/text>",{"id":19,"title":20,"brandStory":21,"brandValues":23,"city":38,"extension":6,"hero":39,"meta":46,"soundsOverview":47,"stem":59,"__hash__":60},"theMaker\u002Fmodals\u002Fthe-maker.json","Chiara Longo",{"abstract":22},"Virrall tells the value of handcraft and the poetry of living materials that change over time. Each garment is born from the encounter of silk, linen, and wool, guided by authenticity and creative freedom. In the most spontaneous processes, even mistakes become opportunities — deviations that lead to new, unexpected, and unique forms.",{"mainImage":24,"values":32},{"desktop":25,"mobile":29},{"src":26,"width":27,"height":28},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fchiara-values-bg-desktop.jpg",1920,1772,{"src":30,"width":31,"height":27},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fchiara-values-bg-mobile.jpg",1080,[33,34,35,36,37],"Imperfection Uniqueness","Freedom Authenticity","Handcraft Transformation","Time Raw Beauty","Fragments Wholeness","Padova",{"abstract1":40,"abstract2":41,"image":42},"I create fashion by hand, starting from imperfect fragments. I like to think that from a “rough piece” something can be born that enhances the one who wears it, and that even mistakes, over time, turn into uniqueness. For me, working with fabrics and textures is not just technique: it is a way of taking time for myself, to breathe, to live better.","My journey began as a game, bending iron wires, and grew into study, research, and passion. I taught myself how to set textures, and fell in love with silk and wool—materials that are always with me. Every creation is “in my own way”: authentic, free, imperfect. This is what guides me — creative freedom, handcraft, and the beauty that rises from imperfection.",{"src":43,"width":44,"height":45},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fchiara-potrait.jpg",1050,1380,{},{"title":48,"subtitle":49,"mainImage":50,"sideImage":54,"abstract":58},"THE SOUND WITHIN","“Every garment is born in silence, yet carries a sound within. five melodies tell what words cannot say.”",{"src":51,"width":52,"height":53},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fsounds-main-image.jpg",990,1438,{"src":55,"width":56,"height":57},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fsounds-side-image.jpg",634,884,"Each chapter does not live in shapes alone. I wanted it to have a voice, a breath of sound. Together with Riccardo Rampazzo, we created five melodies, born with the tales, to give the garments a sense of time and an invisible echo.","modals\u002Fthe-maker","Fp6zKI_Ui2hIEMt2yWQYmll4G50jJJfAgvGEkbqSARE",[62,163,241,320,394],{"id":63,"title":64,"caption":65,"cover":66,"extension":6,"head":75,"lookbook":91,"meta":100,"outro":101,"productGallery":107,"productOverview":142,"productStory":152,"slug":155,"sounds":156,"stem":161,"__hash__":162},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm.json","The House","WOMENSWEAR, SEASON BY SEASON",{"desktop":67,"mobile":70,"thumbnail":72},{"src":68,"width":27,"height":69},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",1600,{"src":71,"width":31,"height":27},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":73,"width":74,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",100,{"abstract":76,"heading1":77,"heading2":78,"sideImage1":79,"sideImage2":83,"mainImage":85,"cursorImage":89},"Freedom dancing beyond boundaries. Precious details for those who live by their own rules.","NOMADIC","THE HOUSE",{"src":80,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fhead-1.jpg",400,530,{"src":84,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fhead-2.jpg",{"src":86,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fhead-main.jpg",1400,1866,{"src":90},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":92,"mainImage":93,"secondaryImage":97,"cursorImage":99},"I dwell in the freedom of movement, in its irregular cadence. I seek an aesthetic that vibrates through the body, sparking a dance without limits. Every rhythm is rebellion, every detail a living presence.",{"src":94,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Flookbook-main.jpg",1150,1540,{"src":98,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg",{"src":90},{},{"abstract":102,"image":103},"I've always felt freedom as a nomadic journey: made of boundless roads and details that endure. If something calls to you, I'm here.",{"src":104,"width":105,"height":106},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Foutro-maker.jpg",934,1204,{"title":108,"gallery":109},"THE COLLECTION",[110,117,122,127,132,137],{"title":111,"image":112,"shopLink":116},"BROKEN HEART DRESS",{"src":113,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fbroken-heart.jpg",1610,2148,"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466104667\u002Fbroken-heart-piece",{"title":118,"image":119,"shopLink":121},"PHILOSOPHER DRESS",{"src":120,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fphilosopher.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4467057805\u002Fphilosopher-piece",{"title":123,"image":124,"shopLink":126},"SELENE'S ORBIT",{"src":125,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fselenes-orbit.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469769360\u002Fselene-s-orbit",{"title":128,"image":129,"shopLink":131},"SELENE DRESS",{"src":130,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fselene-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466077163\u002Fselene-piece",{"title":133,"image":134,"shopLink":136},"AURA BLOUSE",{"src":135,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Faura-earrings.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4471340799\u002Faura-earrings",{"title":138,"image":139,"shopLink":141},"CHAINS DRESS",{"src":140,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469012462\u002Fchains-piece",{"title":128,"price":143,"mainImage":144,"tags":147},90,{"src":145,"width":27,"height":146},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fring-full.jpg",2140,[148,149,150,151],"100% Natural Silk","Handcrafted, hand-finished","Finished with refined hand-stitched details","Relaxed, adjustable silhouette",{"story":153,"crafting":154},"This piece was born from the desire to embody a playful, surprising spirit. Its inspiration is the moon, the ultimate feminine symbol, long associated with life and nature from cycles and fertility to tides and harvests. A magnetic, mysterious force that radiates a vital, untamed energy, capable of transforming everything it touches.","A fully handcrafted piece, made at the bench. The relaxed, adjustable cut features two symbolic details: on one side, a softly pleated crescent drape that recalls soft natural folds; on the other, a finished silk panel.","rhythm",{"bg":157,"song":159},{"src":158},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fsounds\u002Frhytm-ambient.mp3",{"src":160},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fsounds\u002Frhytm-song.mp3","chapters\u002F01_rhythm","nZ54kJWzhAICmi6jgZgPfS7n7yjyPXB8mg2-Cr-TASE",{"id":164,"title":165,"caption":166,"cover":167,"extension":6,"head":174,"lookbook":186,"meta":193,"outro":194,"productGallery":198,"productOverview":222,"productStory":230,"slug":233,"sounds":234,"stem":239,"__hash__":240},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse.json","Spring","THE BLOOM OF BEGINNINGS",{"desktop":168,"mobile":170,"thumbnail":172},{"src":169,"width":27,"height":69},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":171,"width":31,"height":27},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":173,"width":74,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":175,"heading1":176,"heading2":177,"sideImage1":178,"sideImage2":180,"mainImage":182,"cursorImage":184},"A beat etched on the skin, a mark that vibrates. Shimmering surfaces stretch silence, turning it into a living presence.","SACRED","SPRING",{"src":179,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fhead-1.jpg",{"src":181,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fhead-2.jpg",{"src":183,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fhead-main.jpg",{"src":185},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":187,"mainImage":188,"secondaryImage":190,"cursorImage":192},"We are born with the urge to break balance and trace new lines. I seek an aesthetic that refuses to conform, that never asks for approval: it speaks through sharp silences and details that become a manifesto. Every gesture is an affirmation, every gaze a boundary redrawn.",{"src":189,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Flookbook-main.jpg",{"src":191,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg",{"src":185},{},{"abstract":195,"image":196},"I've learned not to fear life's cycles: every transformation is an invitation to be reborn in ways yet unknown. The freedom to express who we are, beyond any form or definition, is a value Virrall embraces.",{"src":197,"width":105,"height":106},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Foutro-maker.jpg",{"title":108,"gallery":199},[200,205,209,214,219],{"title":201,"image":202,"shopLink":204},"COLUMN DRESS",{"src":203,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fcolumn-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4468988304\u002Fcolumnn-piece",{"title":206,"image":207},"DELTA",{"src":208,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fdelta.jpg",{"title":210,"image":211,"shopLink":213},"LAVA DRESS",{"src":212,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Flava-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466113779\u002Flava-piece",{"title":215,"image":216,"shopLink":218},"MORPH DRESS",{"src":217,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fmorph-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466061633\u002Fmorph-piece",{"title":138,"image":220,"shopLink":141},{"src":221,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-piece.jpg",{"title":215,"price":223,"mainImage":224,"tags":226},110,{"src":225,"width":27,"height":146},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fring-full.jpg",[148,227,228,229],"Lost-wool construction","Mirror polish","Finished finish",{"story":231,"crafting":232},"This piece was born almost playfully, starting from the form of a realistic beetle that was deliberately deconstructed and transformed into something new. The rigor of the figure was released, giving way to freedom and experimentation, dissolving into a more abstract and spontaneous gesture. A light yet meaningful creative process that speaks of transformation: as in life, what ends does not disappear, but changes form and continues to exist, revealing unexpected beauty.","Handcrafted using the lost-wool technique. Born from an initial model later transformed, it retains traces of its origin in the open, fragmented structure, evoking at once an eye or a void. The irregular surface, etched with lines that seem to melt away, recalls volcanic matter or a process of decomposition—turning what fades into a new kind of beauty.","pulse",{"bg":235,"song":237},{"src":236},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fsounds\u002Fpulse-ambient.mp3",{"src":238},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fsounds\u002Fpulse-song.mp3","chapters\u002F02_pulse","erv9OH4muqmVCTrYHomhm6SaCJXI_6IkFuzwBDzYb-I",{"id":242,"title":243,"caption":244,"cover":245,"extension":6,"head":252,"lookbook":264,"meta":271,"outro":272,"productGallery":276,"productOverview":303,"productStory":309,"slug":312,"sounds":313,"stem":318,"__hash__":319},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper.json","Summer","THE LIGHT OF THE LONGEST DAYS",{"desktop":246,"mobile":248,"thumbnail":250},{"src":247,"width":27,"height":69},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":249,"width":31,"height":27},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":251,"width":74,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":253,"heading1":254,"heading2":255,"sideImage1":256,"sideImage2":258,"mainImage":260,"cursorImage":262},"A whisper brushing the air, a secret gliding lightly through the forest. A silent elegance that exists only in the details.","SUMMERED","SING",{"src":257,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fhead-1.jpg",{"src":259,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fhead-2.jpg",{"src":261,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fhead-main.jpg",{"src":263},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":265,"mainImage":266,"secondaryImage":268,"cursorImage":270},"I choose the strength of what does not shout. An aesthetic that lives in imperceptible details, in fine lines that remain like a hidden trace. Every silence becomes language, every whisper elegance.",{"src":267,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Flookbook-main.jpg",{"src":269,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg",{"src":263},{},{"abstract":273,"image":274},"I live between extremes and silences, searching every day for the balance that makes everything harmonious. If you recognize it too, I'm here.",{"src":275,"width":105,"height":106},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Foutro-maker.jpg",{"title":108,"gallery":277},[278,283,288,293,298],{"title":279,"image":280,"shopLink":282},"DANGLE BLOUSE",{"src":281,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Fdangle-earrings.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469841328\u002Fdangle-earrings",{"title":284,"image":285,"shopLink":287},"LAYER DRESS",{"src":286,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Flayer-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466122719\u002Flayer-piece",{"title":289,"image":290,"shopLink":292},"LIBRA",{"src":291,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Flibra.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469098158\u002Flibra",{"title":294,"image":295,"shopLink":297},"PETAL BLOUSE",{"src":296,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Fpetal-earrings.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4474024499\u002Fpetal-earrings",{"title":299,"image":300,"shopLink":302},"AXIS DRESS",{"src":301,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Faxis-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4448240483\u002Faxis-piece",{"title":299,"price":304,"mainImage":305,"tags":307},120,{"src":306,"width":27,"height":146},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fring-full.jpg",[148,308,228,151],"Lost wool construction",{"story":310,"crafting":311},"The design draws inspiration from the search for both inner and everyday balance. Two opposing ends — one flat, the other inclined — engage in a dialogue between stability and tension. A balance never final, always on the verge of shifting, embodying the constant oscillation that defines life itself.","Handcrafted through the couture atelier technique, the piece reveals clean, decisive lines with a bold presence. Its smooth, uniform surface enhances the geometry and the sharp contrast between its two ends, while the adjustable opening makes it versatile and effortless to wear.","whisper",{"bg":314,"song":316},{"src":315},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fsounds\u002Fwhisper-ambient.mp3",{"src":317},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fsounds\u002Fwhisper-song.mp3","chapters\u002F03_whisper","fYhPeqtD3QPIn379ND2NNBoovIkBqOkHq-vMclei5G0",{"id":321,"title":322,"caption":323,"cover":324,"extension":6,"head":331,"lookbook":343,"meta":350,"outro":351,"productGallery":355,"productOverview":378,"productStory":383,"slug":386,"sounds":387,"stem":392,"__hash__":393},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance.json","Autumn","THE WARMTH OF FALLING LEAVES",{"desktop":325,"mobile":327,"thumbnail":329},{"src":326,"width":27,"height":69},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":328,"width":31,"height":27},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":330,"width":74,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":332,"heading1":333,"heading2":334,"sideImage1":335,"sideImage2":337,"mainImage":339,"cursorImage":341},"The echo multiplies, silence takes shape. Luminous forms intertwine into precious energy to be worn.","DEEP","AUTUMN",{"src":336,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fhead-1.jpg",{"src":338,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fhead-2.jpg",{"src":340,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fhead-main.jpg",{"src":342},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":344,"mainImage":345,"secondaryImage":347,"cursorImage":349},"I live the city's echo, between neon and concrete. I seek an aesthetic that multiplies reflections and depth, capable of giving vibrations back to every surface. Every mark is resonance, every form a fragment of the Berlin night.",{"src":346,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Flookbook-main.jpg",{"src":348,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg",{"src":342},{},{"abstract":352,"image":353},"Imperfection is the truest mark of who we are, like rock shaped by time: fragile on the surface, yet strong within. If this speaks to you, reach out to me.",{"src":354,"width":105,"height":106},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Foutro-maker.jpg",{"title":108,"gallery":356},[357,360,365,370,373],{"title":299,"image":358,"shopLink":302},{"src":359,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fgallery\u002Faxis-piece.jpg",{"title":361,"image":362,"shopLink":364},"ROCK DRESS",{"src":363,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fgallery\u002Frock-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4448206961\u002Frock-piece",{"title":366,"image":367,"shopLink":369},"RUDE",{"src":368,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fgallery\u002Frude.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469061809\u002Frude",{"title":138,"image":371,"shopLink":141},{"src":372,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-piece.jpg",{"title":374,"image":375,"shopLink":377},"RAW DRESS",{"src":376,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fgallery\u002Fraw-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4467063877\u002Fraw-piece",{"title":361,"price":304,"mainImage":379,"tags":381},{"src":380,"width":27,"height":146},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fring-full.jpg",[148,308,228,382],"Oxidized finish",{"story":384,"crafting":385},"The 'Rock' piece was born from the desire to transform the strength of stone, sculpted by time, into a garment. Its marked surface speaks of erosion by the elements: one side strong and resistant, the other crossed by fissures that let the light seep through. An imperfect balance that reflects the beauty of nature and the memory it carries.","Piece handcrafted using the couture atelier technique. The process creates a textured surface with cavities and reliefs that enhance its sculptural character. The irregular shape and the play of light and shadow make each piece different from the other, celebrating the artisanal process that makes it truly unique.","resonance",{"bg":388,"song":390},{"src":389},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fsounds\u002Fresonance-ambient.mp3",{"src":391},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fsounds\u002Fresonance-song.mp3","chapters\u002F04_resonance","PcaLqhQkIvlGtlmTI1y2uFseZGtZ90RzevHYYP35pOE",{"id":395,"title":396,"caption":397,"cover":398,"extension":6,"head":405,"lookbook":417,"meta":424,"outro":425,"productGallery":429,"productOverview":454,"productStory":459,"slug":462,"sounds":463,"stem":468,"__hash__":469},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise.json","Winter","THE QUIET OF FIRST SNOW",{"desktop":399,"mobile":401,"thumbnail":403},{"src":400,"width":27,"height":69},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":402,"width":31,"height":27},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":404,"width":74,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":406,"heading1":407,"heading2":408,"sideImage1":409,"sideImage2":411,"mainImage":413,"cursorImage":415},"The sea holds its breath, guarding light and mystery. Submerged currents shape forms that shimmer on the skin.","WINTER","CURRENT",{"src":410,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fhead-1.jpg",{"src":412,"width":81,"height":82},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fhead-2.jpg",{"src":414,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fhead-main.jpg",{"src":416},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":418,"mainImage":419,"secondaryImage":421,"cursorImage":423},"I listen to the breath of the sea, to its restrained depth. An aesthetic born from invisible currents, from submerged vibrations resurfacing at the surface. Every trace is mystery, every form a silence that turns into a sign.",{"src":420,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Flookbook-main.jpg",{"src":422,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg",{"src":416},{},{"abstract":426,"image":427},"In silence I find calm and listen to what words cannot tell. The sea is a place that has inspired meif you feel the same, reach out to me.",{"src":428,"width":105,"height":106},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Foutro-maker.jpg",{"title":108,"gallery":430},[431,436,441,446,451],{"title":432,"image":433,"shopLink":435},"CAGE WRAP",{"src":434,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fcage-ear-cuff.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469823121\u002Fcage-ear-cuff",{"title":437,"image":438,"shopLink":440},"CORAL",{"src":439,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fcoral.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469085870\u002Fcoral",{"title":442,"image":443,"shopLink":445},"UNDERTOW DRESS",{"src":444,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fundertow-piece.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466070681\u002Fundertow-piece",{"title":447,"image":448,"shopLink":450},"ISLAND BLOUSE",{"src":449,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fisland-earrings.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4474029668\u002Fisland-earrings",{"title":138,"image":452,"shopLink":141},{"src":453,"width":114,"height":115},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-piece.jpg",{"title":442,"price":223,"mainImage":455,"tags":457},{"src":456,"width":27,"height":146},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fring-full.jpg",[148,227,458,151],"Oxidized surface with finished details",{"story":460,"crafting":461},"This piece was born from the desire to capture the slow movement of seaweed beneath the surface — their silent, vertical sway in a world where time seems suspended. It embodies the deep calm and slowness we often lose today, that fleeting breath we can only sense underwater, in a silence that restores and envelops.","Piece handcrafted using the couture atelier technique. The relaxed, adjustable cut has been oxidized to emphasize its depth and detail. The design is inspired by seaweed, climbing the finger as if defying gravity, with vertical and irregular forms that evoke the fluid, organic movement of the ocean floor.","sub-noise",{"bg":464,"song":466},{"src":465},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fsounds\u002Fsubnoise-ambient.mp3",{"src":467},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fsounds\u002Fsubnoise-song.mp3","chapters\u002F05_subnoise","afN-OtrviWEFILDZhaC1xDHWFpDimjasD_pT5OUJpAw",{"id":471,"title":472,"abstract":473,"extension":6,"image":474,"meta":478,"stem":479,"__hash__":480},"contactsModal\u002Fmodals\u002Fcontacts.json","YOUR STORY, YOUR STYLE.!","If what you’ve seen speaks to you, let’s create something that tells your story. Write to me: your unique garment can start here.",{"src":475,"width":476,"height":477},"\u002Fcontacts\u002Fchiara-info.jpg",370,510,{},"modals\u002Fcontacts","8h2muBYNEjRoZjyt6NP5LexwlAbjt9VXZrrl75yzdDQ",{"id":482,"title":483,"extension":6,"hero":484,"intro":495,"meta":505,"stem":506,"subtitle":507,"__hash__":508},"pages\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage.json","Homepage",{"pretitle":485,"backgroundVideo":486,"soundBg":493},"The Virrall Seasons",{"desktop":487,"mobile":490},{"src":488,"poster":489},"\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fhero\u002Fhero-background-desktop.mp4","\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fhero\u002Fhero-background-desktop-poster.jpg",{"src":491,"poster":492},"\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fhero\u002Fhero-background-mobile.mp4","\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fhero\u002Fhero-background-mobile-poster.jpg",{"src":494},"\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fhero\u002Fhero-bg.mp3",{"title":496,"abstract":497,"caption":498,"sideImage1":499,"sideImage2":503},"THE INVISIBLE ECHO","Before the gesture, there is a sound. Before the form, an echo. Virrall gathers these invisible tracesand transforms them into fashion: five tales exploring matter, time and intimacy.","An invitation to listen to the silence that still resonates within.",{"src":500,"width":501,"height":502},"\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fintro\u002Fintro-01.jpg",500,698,{"src":504,"width":501,"height":502},"\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage\u002Fintro\u002Fintro-02.jpg",{},"pages\u002Fhomepage",null,"PO-fVVRVB85QU8hPKjTmDC9x-Cog641oIWuQ2ww5s6U",{"left":13,"top":13,"width":510,"height":511,"rotate":13,"vFlip":16,"hFlip":16,"body":512},4,16,"\u003Cg fill=\"none\">\u003Crect width=\"1\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" \u002F> \u003Crect width=\"4\" height=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\" \u002F> \u003Crect y=\"15\" width=\"4\" height=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\" \u002F>\u003C\u002Fg>",{"left":13,"top":13,"width":514,"height":514,"rotate":13,"vFlip":16,"hFlip":16,"body":515},20,"\u003Cg fill=\"none\">\u003Cg>\n    \u003Cpath d=\"M6 16V4L14 10L6 16Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"\u002F>\n  \u003C\u002Fg>\u003C\u002Fg>",{"left":13,"top":13,"width":510,"height":511,"rotate":13,"vFlip":16,"hFlip":16,"body":517},"\u003Cg fill=\"none\">\u003Crect x=\"3\" width=\"1\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" \u002F> \u003Crect width=\"4\" height=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\" \u002F> \u003Crect y=\"15\" width=\"4\" height=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\" \u002F>\u003C\u002Fg>",1778443629031]